# =============================================================================
# Merle — Modular Enterprise RPA Lifecycle Engine
# Comprehensive .gitignore (Enterprise-grade, uv + Monorepo + MkDocs + RPA)
# =============================================================================
# Philosophy: Never commit generated, cached, secret, or environment-specific files.
# This file is optimized for:
#   - uv (Python package manager, replaces pip/poetry/pdm)
#   - Python 3.11+ (RPA bots, merle-core, CLI)
#   - MkDocs documentation builds
#   - Docker / Container builds
#   - Pre-commit, Ruff, Mypy, Pytest, Playwright
#   - IDEs (VS Code, PyCharm, Cursor, Zed)
#   - Node.js / Bun / TypeScript (for .opencode/ and rpa-opencode-hybrid)
#   - NATS, Azure, Playwright artifacts
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python (Core)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
*.whl
*.pyo
*.pyd

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Virtual Environments & Package Managers
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/
.conda/
.condarc
.python-version
uv.lock  # NOTE: committed in this repo for reproducibility (remove if you prefer not to)
.pdm.toml
.pdm-python
poetry.lock  # if ever used
Pipfile.lock
.hatch/
.hatchling/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# uv (Astral) specific caches and state
