# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-specific generated (Merle conventions)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Bots generated during development / CI (never commit test bots)
python_bots/test_*/
python_bots/tmp_*/
python_bots/*-test/
# Any local bot clones
bots/
kladde.md

# Example outputs (never commit generated data)
examples/**/reports/
examples/**/logs/
examples/**/data/archive/
examples/**/data/reports/
# Keep this file minimal but explicit — explicit > implicit for enterprise repos.
